  "notes": "Self-test 4 Lamp Matrix Test, stepped forward with public 5 (PinMAME's Right Advance key; a hold of 150 ms or less steps once) through all 96 matrix lamps and back to lamp 00; each step blinks the lamp the display names. Navigation: each Test (-8) press steps to the next self-test (1 the bookkeeping and game adjustments prompt, 2 MEMORY TEST, 3 LAMP CHECK, 4 LAMP MATRIX TEST, 5 RELAY+SOLENOID TEST, 6 SWITCH MATRIX TEST, 7 DISPLAY TEST, 8 SOUND TEST, 9 FRONT DOOR TEST); inside a test public 5 steps forward and public 4 steps back, and in the Relay & Solenoid Test public 3 fires the displayed driver.",
